---
// The About page: consolidates every page that used to be about the person —
// about.html, publications.html, workshop.html, work-with-me.html and
// contact.html (src/fragments/*, the pre-Astro static site) plus src/data/now.json,
// src/data/profile.json, src/data/roles.json and the new src/data/about.mjs
// (books, writing platforms, workshop formats, teaching) — into one page,
// laid out as a bento: every section is one or more cells (.about-cell
// .bento-cell), each carrying the site's one inner padding (--cell-pad) so
// every piece of text lines up with the work grid and the detail page. Every
// fact below is carried over unchanged from those sources (docs/superforge.md:
// never invent numbers) — see scratchpad/NOTES-A.md for exact source paths
// and the two discrepancies found (extra•ordinary's year, CIE LLC's founding
// year) that were left unresolved rather than guessed.
//
// Sections: #intro (hero + stats + orgs), #now, #books, #writing,
// #workshops (talks & workshops), teaching & mentoring, #experience,
// #studio, #work-with-me. vercel.json redirects the old standalone addresses
// (/now, /publications, /workshop, /work-with-me, /studio, /contact) to
// these anchors — keep them.
//
// The rail: this page used to hide the left rail (body.about-page .side {
// display: none }, right below). That local override is removed here per
// the person's request ("About... show them here in the same bento-box
// style" — i.e. inside the normal shell, rail included). src/styles/shell.css
// (agent M's file) also collapses the shell to one column and hides .side
// for body.about-page — that rule has to go too, or the rail stays hidden
// regardless of this file. Flagged in this round's report.
//
// Title: profile.tagline (src/data/profile.json) is the site-wide title /
// positioning source — this page reads it directly via t() instead of
// duplicating it as a literal string, so it can't drift out of sync.
// Round 4 (this round, Takao's live feedback): tagline replaced (was "Design
// & AI Executive · 0→1 Product & Experience Builder · Interactive Media
// Designer" — felt off) with "Creative Director · Interactive Media
// Designer · 0→1 Product & Business Builder", sourced from roles.json (the
// "Executive Creative Director" title at Creativity Is Everywhere LLC, per
// src/fragments/about.html, plus "Creative Director" on the dnt/kitadoko
// client projects; the own-venture roles — cie, intentfirst, breakbias —
// back "0→1 Product & Business Builder"). Same replacement made in
// src/lenses/default.json (title/hero.eyebrow/seo.title/seo.description) so
// the home hero and About agree; tests/strategic-refinement.test.mjs:92
// still asserts the OLD string against about.html and needs updating (not
// mine to edit) — see scratchpad/NOTES-A2.md. Also this round: removed the
// "40+ Verizon designers" stat (Takao: "means little"); regrouped "Selected
// organizations" into ORG_GROUPS (src/data/about.mjs) by actual relationship
// instead of one undifferentiated badge row; the #now cell's bullets and its
// "Updated <month> <year>" label now read from src/data/now.json instead of
// being hardcoded (see formatNowUpdated in about.mjs); Studio and Work with
// me rewritten in plain language (see about.mjs / this file's cells for the
// sourcing of each rewrite).
import Site from "../layouts/Site.astro";
import { t, tb } from "../lib/html.mjs";
import { getLibrary } from "../lib/site.mjs";
import AboutIntro from "../components/home/AboutIntro.astro";
import NowList from "../components/now/NowList.astro";
import {
  BOOKS,
  WRITING_PLATFORMS,
  BREAKBIAS_TOOLS,
  WORKSHOP_FORMATS,
  WORKSHOP_CLIENTS,
  TEACHING,
  ORG_GROUPS,
  formatNowUpdated,
} from "../data/about.mjs";

const lib = getLibrary();
const profile = lib.profile;
const nowData = lib.now;
const nowUpdated = formatNowUpdated(nowData.updatedAt);
---
<Site
  title="About — Takao Umehara"
  description="Creative Director and Interactive Media Designer — games, learning tools, AI products and interactive experiences, from the same creative base."
  canonical="https://takaoumehara.com/about"
  bodyClass="about-page"
>
  <main class="cat-page about-content" data-category="about">
    <div class="about-bento">

      <!-- Hero: portrait, role line, H1, bio — one cell, per the shared bento rule -->
      <section id="intro" class="about-cell bento-cell cell-hero">
        <div class="about-hero-grid">
          <div class="about-hero-copy">
            <p class="about-role" set:html={t(profile.tagline)} />
            <h1 class="about-h1">
              <span class="t-en">I do my best work before the answer is obvious.</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">答えがまだ見えないうちに、いちばん良い仕事をする。</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="about-subtitle">
              <span class="t-en">Creative Director &amp; 0→1 Builder — games, learning tools, AI products and interactive experiences, all from the same creative base.</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">クリエイティブディレクター・0→1 ビルダー。ゲームから学びの道具、AI プロダクト、インタラクティブ体験まで。土台はいつも創造性。</span>
            </p>

            <p class="about-bio">
              <span class="t-en">Based between New York and Japan. Twenty-plus years across brand, product and interactive design — and I do my best work before anyone's agreed on what to build.</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">ニューヨークと日本を拠点に。20 年以上、ブランド・プロダクト・インタラクティブと幅広く手がけてきました。何をつくるかがまだ決まっていない段階が、いちばん力を発揮できるところです。</span>
            </p>
            <p class="about-bio about-bio-2">
              <span class="t-en">I love designing physical games — the kind people play together, in the same room. I like designing for how children learn, where play and learning become the same thing. And I like building AI products, interactive experiences, and the new services, products and businesses that didn't exist yesterday — figuring out what's worth making is half the fun.</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">みんなで同じ場所に集まって遊ぶ、フィジカルなゲームをつくるのが好きです。遊びと学びが分かれていない、子どもの学び方に合わせたものをつくるのも好きです。AI プロダクトやインタラクティブな体験、そして昨日までなかった新しいサービスや事業をつくることも。何をつくるべきかを考えること自体が、半分は楽しみです。</span>
            </p>
            <p class="about-bio about-bio-3">
              <span class="t-en">All of it comes from the same place — creativity. I'm not a specialist in one craft; I'm someone who takes on a wide range of problems from that single base.</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">どれも根っこは同じ、創造性です。ひとつの専門を極める人ではなく、創造性という一つの土台から、幅広い課題に向き合うタイプです。</span>
            </p>
            <!-- Career summary + Resume (PDF) / LinkedIn / Contact: the home
                 About block without its portrait and name (the hero above
                 already has both). -->
            <AboutIntro lib={lib} variant="compact" />
          </div>
          <figure class="about-portrait">
            <picture><source srcset="/assets/about/TakaoUmehara_passport.webp" type="image/webp" /><img src="/assets/about/TakaoUmehara_passport.png" alt="Takao Umehara" width="1024" height="1024" loading="eager" decoding="async" /></picture>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Stats -->
      <section class="about-cell bento-cell cell-stats">
        <div class="about-stats">
          <div class="stat-item">
            <div class="stat-value">20+</div>
            <div class="stat-label">
              <span class="t-en">Years</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">年</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-item">
            <div class="stat-value">20</div>
            <div class="stat-label">
              <span class="t-en">SOSV founders mentored</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">SOSV — メンタリングした創業者</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-item">
            <div class="stat-value">11K+</div>
            <div class="stat-label">
              <span class="t-en">extra•ordinary book copies sold</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">extra•ordinary — 販売部数</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Selected organizations — grouped by relationship (Takao: "unclear
           what 'selected' means" — see src/data/about.mjs ORG_GROUPS for the
           source of each grouping and each org). -->
      <section class="about-cell bento-cell cell-orgs">
        <h2 class="about-h2">
          <span class="t-en">Organizations</span>
          <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">協働した企業・機関</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="org-group-list">
          {ORG_GROUPS.map((group) => (
            <div class="org-group">
              <h3 class="org-group-label" set:html={t(group.label)} />
              <p class="org-group-note" set:html={t(group.note)} />
              <div class="org-badges">
                {group.orgs.map((org) => <span class="org-badge">{org}</span>)}
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Now — bullets and the updated-date label both come from
           src/data/now.json (summary[], updatedAt) through the shared NowList
           (src/components/now/NowList.astro), the same list as the home Now
           section that /now redirects to. formatNowUpdated() (src/data/about.mjs)
           turns "2026-09" into "September 2026" / "2026年9月". -->
      <section id="now" class="about-cell bento-cell cell-now">
        <div class="about-cell-head">
          <h2 class="about-h2">
            <span class="t-en">Now</span>
            <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">いま</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="about-updated">
            <span class="t-en">Updated {nowUpdated.en}</span>
            <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">{nowUpdated.jp}更新</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <NowList lib={lib} />
      </section>

      <!-- Books -->
      <section id="books" class="about-cell bento-cell cell-books">
        <h2 class="about-h2">
          <span class="t-en">Books</span>
          <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">著書</span>
        </h2>
        {BOOKS.map((book) => (
          <div class="book-card">
            <a href={book.links.caseStudy} class="book-cover">
              <img src={book.cover} alt={`${book.title.en} — book cover`} loading="lazy" />
            </a>
            <div class="book-info">
              <h3 class="book-title">
                <span class="t-en">{book.title.en}</span>
                <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">{book.title.jp}</span>
              </h3>
              <p class="book-subtitle" set:html={t(book.subtitle)} />
              <p class="book-summary" set:html={tb(book.summary)} />
              <dl class="book-meta">
                <div class="book-meta-item"><dt><span class="t-en">Year</span><span class="t-jp" lang="ja">刊行年</span></dt><dd>{book.year}</dd></div>
                <div class="book-meta-item"><dt><span class="t-en">Publisher</span><span class="t-jp" lang="ja">出版社</span></dt><dd>{book.publisher}</dd></div>
                <div class="book-meta-item"><dt><span class="t-en">Role</span><span class="t-jp" lang="ja">役割</span></dt><dd set:html={t(book.role)} /></div>
                <div class="book-meta-item"><dt><span class="t-en">Co-author</span><span class="t-jp" lang="ja">共著</span></dt><dd>{book.coAuthor}</dd></div>
                <div class="book-meta-item"><dt><span class="t-en">Copies sold</span><span class="t-jp" lang="ja">販売部数</span></dt><dd>{book.copies}</dd></div>
                <div class="book-meta-item"><dt><span class="t-en">Feature</span><span class="t-jp" lang="ja">掲載</span></dt><dd set:html={t(book.feature)} /></div>
              </dl>
              <div class="book-actions">
                <a href={book.links.caseStudy} class="about-link">
                  <span class="t-en">View case study →</span>
                  <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">ケーススタディを見る →</span>
                </a>
                <a href={book.links.buy} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="about-link">
                  <span class="t-en">Buy on Amazon ↗</span>
                  <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">Amazon で見る ↗</span>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </section>

      <!-- Writing -->
      <section id="writing" class="about-cell bento-cell cell-writing">
        <h2 class="about-h2">
          <span class="t-en">Writing</span>
          <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">文章</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="writing-cards">
          {WRITING_PLATFORMS.map((platform) => (
            <div class="writing-card">
              <div class="writing-card-head">
                <h3 class="writing-title">{platform.name}</h3>
                <span class="writing-kind" set:html={t(platform.kind)} />
              </div>
              <p class="writing-excerpt" set:html={tb(platform.blurb)} />
              <ul class="writing-article-list">
                {platform.articles.map((article) => (
                  <li>
                    <a href={article.url ?? platform.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener" set:html={t(article.title)} />
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ul>
              <a href={platform.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="writing-link">
                <span class="t-en">More on {platform.host} →</span>
                <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">{platform.host} で読む →</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Talks & Workshops -->
      <section id="workshops" class="about-cell bento-cell cell-workshops">
        <h2 class="about-h2">
          <span class="t-en">Talks &amp; Workshops</span>
          <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">講演・ワークショップ</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="about-text">
          <span class="t-en">Short intensives on interactive craft + AI build environments (not prompt theater), built on <strong>Break Bias</strong> — 8 systematic transformation tools developed over 15 years.</span>
          <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">インタラクティブの手仕事と、AI 前提のビルド環境についての短期集中（プロンプト劇ではない）。15 年以上かけて体系化した <strong>Break Bias</strong> の 8 つの思考ツールが土台。</span>
        </p>
        <ul class="about-list about-list--tight">
          <li><span class="t-en">For new ventures</span><span class="t-jp" lang="ja">新規事業・0→1</span></li>
          <li><span class="t-en">For product &amp; innovation teams</span><span class="t-jp" lang="ja">プロダクト・イノベーションチーム</span></li>
          <li><span class="t-en">For creative challenges</span><span class="t-jp" lang="ja">クリエイティブ課題解決</span></li>
          <li><span class="t-en">For leadership teams</span><span class="t-jp" lang="ja">経営・リーダーシップ層</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="about-subhead">
          <span class="t-en">The 8 BreakBias tools</span>
          <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">BreakBias — 8 つの思考ツール</span>
        </p>
        <div class="tool-badges">
          {BREAKBIAS_TOOLS.map((tool) => <span class="tool-badge">{tool}</span>)}
        </div>
        <p class="about-subhead">
          <span class="t-en">Formats</span>
          <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">実施形式</span>
        </p>
        <ul class="format-list">
          {WORKSHOP_FORMATS.map((f) => (
            <li>
              <span class="format-time" set:html={t(f.time)} />
              <strong class="format-name" set:html={t(f.name)} />
              <span class="format-desc" set:html={tb(f.desc)} />
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <p class="about-subhead">
          <span class="t-en">Delivered at</span>
          <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">実績</span>
        </p>
        <div class="org-badges org-badges--tight">
          {WORKSHOP_CLIENTS.map((c) => <span class="org-badge">{c}</span>)}
        </div>
        <p class="about-cta">
          <a href="#work-with-me" class="about-link">
            <span class="t-en">Ask about a workshop →</span>
            <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">ワークショップについて問い合わせる →</span>
          </a>
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Teaching & Mentoring -->
      <section id="teaching" class="about-cell bento-cell cell-teaching">
        <h2 class="about-h2">
          <span class="t-en">Teaching &amp; mentoring</span>
          <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">教えること、学ぶこと</span>
        </h2>
        <ul class="teaching-list">
          {TEACHING.map((item) => (
            <li class="teaching-item">
              <span class="teaching-tag" set:html={t(item.tag)} />
              <p class="teaching-title">
                <span set:html={t(item.title)} />
                {item.period && <span class="teaching-period"> ({item.period})</span>}
              </p>
              <p class="teaching-desc" set:html={tb(item.desc)} />
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Experience: the career timeline, from the old about.html -->
      <section id="experience" class="about-cell bento-cell cell-experience">
        <h2 class="about-h2">
          <span class="t-en">Experience</span>
          <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">経歴</span>
        </h2>
        <ul class="timeline-list">
          <li class="timeline-item">
            <p class="timeline-role">
              <span class="t-en"><strong>Creativity Is Everywhere LLC</strong> — Founder &amp; Creative Director (2006–Present)</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja"><strong>Creativity Is Everywhere LLC</strong> — Founder &amp; Creative Director（2006年〜現在）</span>
            </p>
            <p class="timeline-desc">
              <span class="t-en">Leading a specialized studio partnering with ventures and enterprises across the US and Japan — AI product strategy, brand architecture and 0→1 venture creation for clients including Emerson Collective and the Tokyo Metropolitan Government.</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">日米の企業やスタートアップと協働するクリエイティブスタジオを主宰。Emerson Collective、東京都などのプロダクト設計、ブランド構築、AI 戦略を推進。</span>
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="timeline-item">
            <p class="timeline-role">
              <span class="t-en"><strong>Verizon</strong> — Lead Product Designer, AI Enablement (contract, 2025–2026)</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja"><strong>Verizon</strong> — Lead Product Designer, AI Enablement（契約・2025〜2026年）</span>
            </p>
            <p class="timeline-desc">
              <span class="t-en">Leading AI workflow transformation across product design organizations — enabling 40+ designers and 80+ cross-functional partners to adopt generative tools, agentic prototypes and scalable design systems.</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">プロダクトデザイン組織における AI ワークフロー変革を主導。40名以上のデザイナーと80名以上のステークホルダーが自律型プロトタイピングや生成ツールを活用できる仕組みを構築。</span>
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="timeline-item">
            <p class="timeline-role">
              <span class="t-en"><strong>School of Visual Arts (SVA)</strong> — Adjunct Professor, Graphic Design (2024)</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja"><strong>SVA</strong> — 非常勤教授・グラフィックデザイン学科（2024年）</span>
            </p>
            <p class="timeline-desc">
              <span class="t-en">Taught Advanced Typography — mentored BFA students in modern type systems, digital kinetic layouts, and contemporary graphic rigor in New York City.</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">ニューヨーク本校にてアドバンスド・タイポグラフィを担当。現代のタイポグラフィ体系と動的表現を指導。</span>
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="timeline-item">
            <p class="timeline-role">
              <span class="t-en"><strong>Concentrix Catalyst</strong> — Lead Product Designer / Design Manager (2021–2023)</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja"><strong>Concentrix Catalyst</strong> — リードプロダクトデザイナー / デザイン マネージャー（2021〜2023年）</span>
            </p>
            <p class="timeline-desc">
              <span class="t-en">Architected a major US banking portal spanning 105 screens, full design system tokens, and self-service servicing for cardholders nationwide.</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">全米大手銀行のクレジットカードポータルを設計。105画面のUI、網羅的なデザインシステム、強固なアクセシビリティを策定。</span>
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="timeline-item">
            <p class="timeline-role">
              <span class="t-en"><strong>SOSV</strong> — Startup Coach, Product Design &amp; Branding (2019–2020)</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja"><strong>SOSV</strong> — スタートアップコーチ・プロダクトデザイン &amp; ブランディング（2019〜2020年）</span>
            </p>
            <p class="timeline-desc">
              <span class="t-en">Coached 20 founders of Food and Blockchain seed-stage startups on customer discovery, UX strategy, identity design and go-to-market storytelling.</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">フードテックおよびブロックチェーン分野の創業者20名に対し、ユーザー体験設計、ブランド構築、事業立ち上げ時の実践的ガイダンスを提供。</span>
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="timeline-item">
            <p class="timeline-role">
              <span class="t-en"><strong>ProjectEd</strong> — Product Design Lead / Design Strategy Lead (2015–2018)</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja"><strong>ProjectEd</strong> — プロダクトデザインリード / デザイン戦略リード（2015〜2018年）</span>
            </p>
            <p class="timeline-desc">
              <span class="t-en">Designed a research productivity platform for the Carnegie Foundation, and led product and design strategy for education and research platforms.</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">Carnegie Foundation の研究プラットフォームを設計。教育・研究分野のプラットフォームで、プロダクトとデザインの戦略を率いた。</span>
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="timeline-item">
            <p class="timeline-role">
              <span class="t-en"><strong>Amplify Education</strong> — Product Design Lead / Design Strategy Coach (2009–2015)</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja"><strong>Amplify Education</strong> — プロダクトデザインリード / デザイン戦略コーチ（2009〜2015年）</span>
            </p>
            <p class="timeline-desc">
              <span class="t-en">Spearheaded 10+ ELA Quests releases, combining narrative storytelling, gamified mechanics and educational standards into learning apps used daily by millions of US students.</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja">ELA Quests シリーズ10作以上のプロダクト立ち上げを主導。物語とゲーム性、学習指導要領を融合し、全米数百万人の児童・生徒が利用する教育基盤を構築。</span>
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="timeline-item">
            <p class="timeline-role">
              <span class="t-en"><strong>Ogilvy Brand Integration Group (BIG)</strong> — Senior Designer (2007–2008)</span>
              <span class="t-jp" lang="ja"><strong>Ogilvy BIG</strong> — シニアデザイナー（2007〜2008年）</span>
            </p>
            <p class="timeline-desc">
              <span class="t-en">Collaborated on Coca-Cola's worldwide visual identity refresh — global visual guidelines, packaging principles and cross-medium brand applications.</span>
